cket contracts. Keep scope/lowering/prelude/primitives/render/session evaluation in jolt. Also route the parser-dependent completeness probe through this worker or its equivalent diagnostic packet; otherwise multiline behavior diverges. One long-lived worker amortizes startup; no process per expression.\ncollab/jolt/1792423156000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r2.gpt-6-astra.findings.md:233:| F2 | Accepted | §§1, 7, J5, Q3: JVM/Node/Dart AOT worker parameter; generated-target evidence `yang.antlr.md:496–500,3229–3231`, builds `bb.edn:6–31`. |\ncollab/jolt/1793096000000-engineer-j6-autobahn-harness-prep.codex.findings.md:71:Total **299 must-pass + 2 exception-listed + 216 N/A**; **301 execute per role**. The two exceptions are **7.13.1 (close 5000)** and **7.13.2 (close 65535)**. Upstream always labels these INFORMATIONAL. Four exact case/role rows require both informational labels **and actual `remoteCloseCode=1002`**, with no timeout flags. No FAILED waiver is permitted. The out-of-range/protocol-error basis is [RFC 6455 §§7.4/11.7](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6455.html#section-11.7). This is a proposed stricter response assertion, not acceptance of upstream's broad “undefined” language.\ncollab/jolt/1792423926000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r3.gpt-6-astra.prompt.md:14:/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/collab/1792423926000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r3.gpt-6-astra.findings.md\ncollab/jolt/1792423926000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r3.gpt-6-astra.prompt.md:15:Base it on your r2 file (collab/1792423156000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r2.gpt-6-astra.findings.md). Do not edit earlier files. Write only that file.\ncollab/jolt/1792424621000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r4.gpt-6-astra.prompt.md:17:Base it on your r3 file (collab/1792423926000-architect-jolt-lane-plan-r3.gpt-6-astra.findings.md). Do not edit earlier files. Write only that file.\ncollab/jolt/1794087000000-engineer-j6g-index-incremental.prompt.md:18:   collab/jolt/1794006000000-architect-j6g-ruling.gpt-6.1-sol.ruling.md in\n",